      "purpose": "`webhook` is a protocol-independent Go module for exact-byte webhook verification, replay protection, deterministic outbound signing, and bounded delivery. It uses `net/http`, HMAC-SHA-256 or HMAC-SHA-512, explicit clocks and limits, and no production `unsafe` or cgo.",
